===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|[[turteltūbe]], [[türteltūbe]]}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|turtulatūba}}, {{m|goh|turtultūba}}, {{m|goh|turtiltūba}}, from {{etyl|ML.|de}} {{m|la|tortella}}, {{m|la|turtella}} (two [[Middle Latin]] [[diminutive]] forms), from {{etyl|la|de}} {{m|la|turtur}} (an [[onomatopoeic]] word imitative of the dove’s call, i.e., its [[coo]] or [[cooing]]). Analysable as {{compound|turteln|Taube|t2=dove, pigeon|lang=de}}

